'''Sector S-11''' was an area on the [[planet]] [[Onderon]] that was suspected by the occupying [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]] to contain a secret base maintained by the [[Onderon rebels]]. However, the Onderon Rebels' [[Saw Gerrera's camp|true base]] was located in [[Sector S-29]] at the time.<ref name="A War on Two Fronts" />

